cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: PDF Scholar
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Halseth
    given-names: Emil Mathias Strøm
repository-code: https://github.com/emilmsh/pdf-scholar
url: https://emilmsh.github.io/pdf-scholar/
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A PDF reader and annotator for Windows, built for research. The window is
  nearly all page — one slim toolbar, and everything else out of the way until
  called. Annotation at the selected text, split view, an optional AI assistant
  that cites its sources, and a Norwegian/English interface. Available as a
  desktop app and a browser extension.
keywords:
  - pdf
  - annotation
  - reading
  - research-tools
  - electron
